        "TileImage": "$($repository 6e7f5b98-2a0d-46a7-975c-9013102c3790).Image",
        "Description": "Have you ever done a bank heist before? Well your going to be taking out not gold but a templar. Mateo Perez, High profile Templar agent. His goal is to siphon funds from the bank himself to wire to Templar accounts making them rich. We can not allow that to happen. At the same time you will be taking out 2 other Templar opperatives who got him the top job to begin with, Kevin Nardone &amp; Melissa Chien.\rMake sure you get in &amp; out smoothly.\rGood luck Agent.",
